timeseries { req = sum(dt.service.request.count), fail = sum(dt.service.request.failure_count), rt = avg(dt.service.request.response_time) }, by: {dt.entity.service}
| fields Service = entityName(dt.entity.service), Requests = arraySum(req), Failures = arraySum(fail), `Avg response time (µs)` = arrayAvg(rt)
